<title>GREECE: NATIONAL BANK'S KOULETSIS JOINS NATWEST BANK, ATHENS.</title>
<headline>NATIONAL BANK'S KOULETSIS JOINS NATWEST BANK, ATHENS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yiannis Kouletsis, formerly a forex dealer at state National Bank of Greece, joined the forex desk at NatWest, Athens, market sources said.</p>
<p>Kouletsis officially assumed his duties at NatWest on June 26, they said.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
